---
// Solution Section - What Her First Income Is & The Philosophy of Choosing One Path
---

<section class="section section-solution" id="solution">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-label">A Calmer Approach</span>
      <h2>A Grounded, Honest Framework for At-Home Earnings</h2>
      <p>
        No gimmicks. No complicated software stacks. Just clear, honest clarity to help you select one viable path and set it up properly.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="solution-grid">
      <div class="solution-column solution-manifesto">
        <h3>The Philosophy Behind Her First Income</h3>
        <p>
          Most advice fails because it assumes you have 40 uninterrupted hours every week, a large advertising budget, and an advanced degree in web development.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Her First Income</strong> was designed with the opposite premise: what if you only have 60 to 90 minutes of quiet time a day, zero desire to dance on camera, and want to use free, reputable tools to launch something legitimate?
        </p>
        <div class="solution-highlight-box">
          <div class="highlight-title">The "Pick One" Principle</div>
          <p>
            You don't need to chase multiple ideas. Real traction comes from selecting a single viable model that aligns with your personality and schedule, and following through without distraction.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="solution-column solution-pillars">
        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-number">01</div>
          <div class="pillar-body">
            <h4>No Expensive Software Required</h4>
            <p>Every path is mapped using free, accessible tools. You never need to pay for high-ticket software before making a single dollar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-number">02</div>
          <div class="pillar-body">
            <h4>Paced for Small Pockets of Time</h4>
            <p>Checklists and templates are broken into bite-sized, independent actions that fit around real daily routines.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-card">
          <div class="pillar-number">03</div>
          <div class="pillar-body">
            <h4>Clean Separation & Legal Basics</h4>
            <p>Practical checklists cover setting up dedicated accounts, Stripe/PayPal payment basics, and simple income tracking from day one.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-solution {
    background-color: var(--bg-page);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .solution-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 840px) {
    .solution-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
      gap: 3.5rem;
    }
  }

  .solution-manifesto h3 {
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-headline);
  }

  .solution-manifesto p {
    font-size: 1.025rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-body);
    margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
  }

  .solution-highlight-box {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    padding: 1.35rem;
    background-color: var(--sage-50);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--sage-700);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
  }

  .highlight-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--sage-800);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .solution-highlight-box p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-body);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .solution-pillars {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .pillar-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.35rem;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
  }

  .pillar-number {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    line-height: 1;
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .pillar-body h4 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--text-headline);
  }

  .pillar-body p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
